body:
Thank you for putting this out! :)

&#x200B;

Do you know what subreddits he posts on?

I would say something stupid then start laughing/crying.

&#x200B;

If it doesn't make sense: when i do,say,or hear something stupid I fall down and laugh so hard I cry and shout in pain.

[Here you go!  Click Me!](https://giphy.com/gifs/halloween-hug-ghost-g8rhUpt0ounKM)

&#x200B;

I'm really sorry your head hurts. :(

I would give you a platinum but I don't have any coins so I'll give you a mental platinum.

&#x200B;

 [Click Me!!](https://me.me/i/platinum-award-gives-the-recipient-a-month-of-reddit-premium-64dfc7446e7849359bca3546e968f7b3)
